# Dutch: the rules the formant voice speaks it by (docs/tts.md,
# "Other languages"). Written from Dutch spelling: g and ch as the velar fricative, the vowel pairs, final devoicing. Stress: the first syllable after an unstressed prefix.
name Dutch
stress first
prefixes be ge ver her ont
unstressed 0
vowels aeiouy
weak de het een en of van in op te met voor aan is er

